{"ref":"BDB, שַׁמָּה³","hw":"שַׁמָּה³","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  in Edom <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:13\" href=\"/Genesis.36.13\">Gn 36:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:17\" href=\"/Genesis.36.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.37\">1 Ch 1:37</a>, usually Σομε.<br><strong>2.</strong>  third son of Jesse <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.9\">1 S 16:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.13\">17:13</a>, Σαμ(μ)α, 𝔊L Σαμαα; v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שִׁמְעָא\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׁמְעָא\">שִׁמְעָא</a>, <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שִׁמְעָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׁמְעָה\">שִׁמְעָה</a>, <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, שִׁמְעִי\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_שִׁמְעִי\">שִׁמִעִי</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  Σαμαια(ς), etc., heroes of David: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.11\">2 S 23:11</a> (om. accid. ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.13\">1 Ch 11:13</a> Dr), v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.33\">33</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.25\">25</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.27\">1 Ch 11:27</a>, Σαμαωθ, Σαμ(μ)ωθ; prob. also <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁמְהוּת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.8\">1 Ch 27:8</a>.","next":"BDB, שַׁמּוֹת²","prev":"BDB, שַׁמָּה²"}